OL,3,GNEWSAMayor sorry rival 'erased' from
OL,4,ARemembrance photo
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town's mayor has apologised after he
OL,7,Fposted a photograph of a Remembrance
OL,8,FSunday commemoration with a rival
OL,9,Fpolitician edited out.
OL,11,FSomerset Labour councillor Leigh Redman
OL,12,Fsaid he "regrets that the post has
OL,13,Fbecome a distraction from what should
OL,14,Fbe a day of remembrance, reflection and
OL,15,Frespect".
OL,17,FConservative councillor Diogo Rodrigues
OL,18,Fsaid it was "insensitive" that he had
OL,19,Fbeen "erased" from the photo which was
OL,20,Ftaken in Bridgwater on Sunday. He said
OL,21,Fhe had taken "great offence" from the
OL,22,F"disrespectful" act.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
