OL,3,GNEWSAMayor sorry rival 'erased' from
OL,4,ARemembrance photo
OL,5,
OL,6,FRedman said he had not intended to
OL,7,Fcause offence but that he "accepted
OL,8,Fthat concern had been caused". He
OL,9,Foffered his "sincere apologies" to
OL,10,FRodrigues "and anyone else who was
OL,11,Fupset".
